  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ers&#xe4;ttning till IDEA f&#xf6;r skatter och lokalhyra 2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reimbursement to IDEA for premises and taxes 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">According to the Host Country Agreement between International IDEA and Sweden, the Swedish Government will annually reimburse International IDEA for the office rent and for tax payable by officials of the organisation who are not exempted from tax in Sweden.
The Government Offices of Sweden (Swedish Ministry for Foreign Affairs) has granted a contribution amounting to 9 014 052 SEK to International IDEA to cover the cost of renting office space during the period of 1 January 2025 &#x2013; 31 December 2025 and a contribution amounting to 19 132 304 Swedish kronor to International IDEA for tax payable by officials of the organization who are not exempted from tax during 2024.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Avgift enligt v&#xe4;rdlandsavtal f&#xf6;r ers&#xe4;ttning av hyra 2025 och skattebefrielse f&#xf6;r 2024</narrative>
  </description>
